// Resources of sm2runtime.dll: the launcher's music (generated for sm2port with ElevenLabs Music), its 8 background
// pictures (generated for sm2port with Magnific) and fonts (Barlow Semi Condensed, SIL Open Font License, see
// third_party/fonts/OFL.txt). In the DLL, not in sm2.exe, whose image the XBE overwrites.
